msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh, Kiryu-san... It's such a shame what happened to your orphanage..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "I'm just glad the kids are safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"It turns out that all this talk about the resort bringing money to Okinawa "
"was a lie. The only ones getting rich are the yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"I was more than willing to move out of my house if it was for the good of "
"Okinawa, but now I've made up my mind."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"I've decided to defend my home, even if it's the last thing I'll ever do. "
"It's my house, and nobody is going to take it from me, no matter what."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "People from Okinawa certainly are strong."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"If you're planning to bring the fight back to those nasty yakuza, I'd be "
"happy to look after the children while you're gone!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "Thank you... You take care of yourself, too."
msgstr ""

